  "description": {
    "text": "VSTAR Special Set, released on 5 August 2022: eight Lost Abyss packs, a VSTAR marker and a V & VSTAR promo card pack holding one of three pairs, Zacian VSTAR and Zacian V, Zamazenta VSTAR and Zamazenta V, or Rotom VSTAR and Rotom V. The Zamazenta V gives Start Deck 100's card a new illustration.",
